    ["竞技功能已解锁，现在可以参与竞技玩法"] = "Competition function is unlocked; you can now participate in competition gameplay.",
    ["罗塞尔四处征战，成就大帝之名，同时曾作为知识皇帝的他，收集了有关战争的历史，其中最为庞杂丰富的便是第四纪的四皇之战。\n在罗塞尔大帝陨落之后，祂的知识与意志并未消散，而是与王冠结合，成为了知识王冠。其中蕴含着最为丰富的一处知识，承载着祂对\"四皇之战\"的全部记忆——那些血与火的岁月、征服与被征服的史诗、王朝兴衰的轨迹，被知识皇冠的光芒永久镌刻。\n末日降临，母神的威胁逼近，祂影响了知识皇冠让其权柄自行运转，以知识带来\"创造\"，于是，一个前所未有的存在诞生了——\n「战略服」，一个由罗塞尔的战争记忆与知识皇冠的历史推演能力，共同编织的平行空间集合体。\n\"战略服，等你入局。\""] = "Roselle fought everywhere, achieving the name of Great Emperor. At the same time, as the Knowledge Emperor, he collected history related to war, the most complex and rich of which was the War of the Four Emperors in the Fourth Epoch.\nAfter the fall of Emperor Roselle, His knowledge and will did not dissipate, but combined with the crown to become the Knowledge Crown. It contains the richest piece of knowledge, carrying all His memories of the \"War of the Four Emperors\"—those years of blood and fire, the epics of conquering and being conquered, and the trajectories of the rise and fall of dynasties were permanently engraved by the light of the Knowledge Crown.\nThe apocalypse descended, and the threat of the Mother Goddess approached. She influenced the Knowledge Crown to make its authority operate on its own, bringing \"creation\" through knowledge. Thus, an unprecedented existence was born—\n\"Strategic Server\", a collection of parallel spaces woven together by Roselle's war memories and the historical deduction ability of the Knowledge Crown.\n\"Strategic Server, waiting for you to enter the game.\"",
